			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=146" title="View the profile of simplee">simplee</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 138<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/devil1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								smoked again................    ranger down!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=146"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1142.msg11350#msg11350"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1142.msg11350#msg11350">Re: New content not worth it?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #15 on:</b> September 21, 2004, 05:08:12 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1142.msg11337#msg11337">Quote from: simplee on September 21, 2004, 11:24:08 am</a></div><div class="quote">....and I know that serverwide the rangers are stuck on theirs also.  <br /></div><br />Let me state again... the rangers are STUCK on their epic as stated on every ranger board known to EQ...<br /><br />For reference, click on either of the two ranger boards listed under EQ Class Links, or go to <a href="http://www.eqrangers.com" target="_blank">www.eqrangers.com</a>.&nbsp; All will tell you where to start, and the stalling spot where every other ranger in the game is stuck... the *&amp;^%ing note that Corun gives us with as much as a vague clue as to &quot;someone, somewhere&quot; that knows something about diseases of the mind.&nbsp; Additionally, you can find the list of virtually every zone in the game that has been searched and hundreds of NPC&#039;s that have been hailed and had the note handed to them, as well as which ones eat the note, and which ones don&#039;t respond at all.<br /><br />For further information, join serverwide.rangerepic:epic.<br /><br />Sorry, this is a frustrating issue for a lot of people as we&#039;ve been stuck on this same thing for days now, and seeing as our epic was changed from a bow to a sword just weeks before the expansion was released, there&#039;s speculation that the quest may be intentionally stalled as they haven&#039;t finished it yet.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
