							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Warriors are also stuck on their epic 1.5.&nbsp; The suspicion is that a needed drop doesn&#039;t exist in the game.<br /><br />In other news, apparently the SK epic 1.5 is given out free with the purchase of any extra value meal.&nbsp; Don&#039;t forget to supersize.<br /><br /><br /><br />
